      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "戦兵（せんぺい）凡そ二百人、但し一小隊凡そ五十人宛（あて）"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Combat troops of Hayashida (林田藩): approximately 200 men, with a proviso that one platoon numbers about fifty (implying four platoons). Fascicle 8 prints a domain's military after its officials, so this column overflows to the right of the ○牟原藩 marker and belongs to Hayashida, not Muhara. (MASTER erroneously also lists this figure under 牟原; there is only one 戰兵 column and it is Hayashida's.)"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "林田戰兵"
